        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend: blue boxes are entities; each line is a relationship.&#10;PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; UQ = unique with caregiver_id; 1 = exactly one; 0..* = zero or more.&#10;Each call belongs to one pairing. A pairing is account eligibility, not resident consent." style="html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=25;fontColor=#20313B;align=center;rounded=0;fillColor=#F7F9FA;strokeColor=#C9D2D7;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
